# Loaded automatically by `vite build` (and only by it - dev reads .env /
# .env.development instead). Committed on purpose: it holds no secret, and its
# whole job is to make the production default explicit rather than implied.
#
# Empty means "same origin". Deployed, Express serves this build and the API
# from one origin, so fetches want to be relative /api/... paths - see
# src/config.ts. Point this at a full URL only if the two ever get split, and
# read the sameSite note in authRoutes.ts before you do.
VITE_API_URL=
